he company offers automotive products including leaf bolts, spring bolt W nuts, casting products, bushes, hub bolts, nuts, pins, propeller shaft components, trailer axles, and trailer suspension and sub-assemblies. It also provides earth movement and construction components, including pins, side cutter, teeth, bushes, and fasteners; and propeller shaft components, such as leaf spring, full yoke, rear teeth, cross holder, coupling flange, half yoke, water pump assy, UJ cross, tie rod end and drag link kits, wheel spanners, and jack pod, as well as offers designing solutions for product performance and quality improvement. The company operates in India, the United Kingdom, Germany, Holland, Malaysia, Saudi Arabia, Iran, the United Arab Emirates, the United States, Morocco, Egypt, the Philippines, Afghanistan, Singapore, Bahrain, Kuwait, and Kenya. The company was formerly known as Gurmukh Singh & Sons Auto Parts Private Limited and changed its name to G.S. Auto International Limited in 1985. G.S. Auto International Limited was founded in 1938 and is based in Ludhiana, India.","employees":614,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795530103},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795530102,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"G.S. Auto International\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"G S Auto International Ltd. Share Price Today - G S Auto International Ltd. Stock Price Live NSE/BSE","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795168680,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPajBHU21SMFBGb0dBcDVrR1VOZGoxZ2xfeFNUVUo3RGIwWVNPREh6VVVIZzdmS1N6TW05c3E4ellVaVdnZ25VQUNSY1J6Mkp3UmFGODNlcUJnT3hoY2xKWXFHSWRJeWNpRUFxLXh2WWwzVWUySlJtSmtzRlBFdHc4T1ZTWGd0R1YwemppcEln?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Top 56 Auto Ancillary Stocks In India For November 2026","s":"Samco","d":1794552688,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNcXh5VUpYa01vREZsRU11YUg2R1MwMUVXTlVWSlZwb1NRbHBKSWhVamZfcEJ1bkVSczdvMnkxN1JjYlczM0ZfTVd